ith smooth curved shoulders, a long straight-sided body, a thick rounded base, and an open threaded mouth at the top. The glass is intensely saturated crimson red, with darker internal tones caused by transparency and overlapping reflections, and brighter scarlet highlights along the edges and shoulders. Thin bright specular streaks run vertically down both sides of the bottle, especially along the left and right contours, emphasizing the polished glass material. The neck shows clear spiral threading around the rim area, rendered with alternating dark red shadow bands and bright reflective highlights. The bottle mouth is circular and open, seen from a slightly low-to-straight-on perspective, with a dark inner cavity and subtle greenish glass tint around the lip and base edges. The body widens smoothly from the shoulder into a broad cylinder, then narrows slightly into a heavy transparent base with layered reflections and reddish refractions. Lighting appears studio-like, with strong directional highlights from the front-left and upper areas, producing a clean commercial product-rendering look. The composition is minimal, centered, and isolated, with no label, cap, hands, surrounding props, or environmental setting visible. The image has an alpha channel and a transparent background.\n", "", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 681, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_1", "label": "参考图 1 (Image-1)", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "参考图 1 (Image-1)"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 717, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "negative_prompt"}, "name": "negative_prompt", "label": "negative_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "negative_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "INT",